<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43315" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαγγέλ-ιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reward of good
			tidings</i>, given to the messenger, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαγγέλιον δέ μοι ἔστω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.152
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ . . εὐ. τόδε τείσω</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				166
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολήψῃ τὸ εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				17
			</span></i>: in 
				Att.
			 always in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαγγέλια
			θύειν</span> to make a thank-offering for <i>good-tidings</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				7.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Pk.</u>
				415
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. θύειν ἑκατὸν βοῦς τῇ θεῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					656
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐβουθύτει ὡς εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.3.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαγγελίων θυσίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.160
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. στεφανοῦν, ἀναδῆσαί
			τινα</span>, to crown one for <i>good news brought</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				647
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				765
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστεφανωμένη ἐπ᾽ εὐαγγελίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sert.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				1.362.7
			</span></i> (Samos, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>good tidings, good news</i>, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ki.</u>
				4.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				2.3.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.40.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
				105.40
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>: sg., <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.17.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				3.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				421
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Christian sense, <i>the gospel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Gal.
				1.11
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
